{
  "_comment": "Golden questions for backend/scripts/eval_sous_chef.py. Each case names a published recipe slug (seeded by backend/seed.py), a question, and rule-based expectations. Run against the real model before any change to SYSTEM_RULES or CLASSIFIER_RULES; paste the table into the PR.",
